  "non_claims": [
    "PKSMP4 qualifies exactly one AP, one AP-owned root, one page, and one generation in one frozen two-vCPU Sandy Bridge TCG profile; it is not general SMP or a general shootdown subsystem.",
    "The capability token is a fixed development value and is not a production capability minting, delegation, revocation, or secrecy mechanism.",
    "The shootdown operation performs exactly one AP-side INVLPG for the frozen probe; it does not implement INVPCID, CR3 reload shootdowns, address-space-wide invalidation, multi-AP masks, or multiple concurrent generations.",
